                                                    "children": [],
                                                    "className": "android.widget.TextView",
                                                    "text": "A Harder break, early end, rule deletion, switch-off or loosening waits 1 minute for the first confirmed change in a block, then 5, then 15 for each later change. For a daily limit, the wait count lasts until Flint's saved daily reset; changing the phone's day does not restart the count. After the wait, confirm the change. A granted break lasts up to five minutes and ends sooner if the block ends.",
